# Supervisor Agent

When asked to choose or orchestrate agents, read `.cursor/skills/supervisor-agent/SKILL.md`.
Select the smallest applicable skill sequence. Do not delegate a simple lookup or one continuous trace. Do not spawn agents unless the user asks for delegation or the task has substantial independent workstreams.
`CLAUDE.md`, explicit user approval, and runtime safety rules always take precedence.
